# No chat rename (hard)

Do not rename the chat. Do not call rename chat.

Exception, only when both are true in the same PO message:

1. The PO explicitly asks to rename the chat.
2. The PO gives the exact new title string.

Do not invent a title. Do not rename as part of task completion, role detection, or closeout.
